      case "arrowLabel": {const paths={right:"M18 48 H284 V18 L390 100 L284 182 V152 H18 Q8 152 8 142 V58 Q8 48 18 48 Z",left:"M382 48 H116 V18 L10 100 L116 182 V152 H382 Q392 152 392 142 V58 Q392 48 382 48 Z",down:"M48 8 H352 Q362 8 362 18 V116 H392 L200 192 L8 116 H38 V18 Q38 8 48 8 Z",up:"M48 192 H352 Q362 192 362 182 V84 H392 L200 8 L8 84 H38 V182 Q38 192 48 192 Z"},positions={right:[155,83,127,310,106],left:[245,83,127,90,106],down:[200,52,94,200,122],up:[200,116,158,200,184]},p=positions[direction];body=`<path d="${paths[direction]}" fill="${active}"/><text x="${p[0]}" y="${p[1]}" text-anchor="middle" fill="${ink}" font-size="${ts}" font-weight="700">${text}</text><text x="${p[0]}" y="${p[2]}" text-anchor="middle" fill="${ink}" font-size="${Math.max(20,Math.min(vs,44))}" font-weight="700">${shown}</text>${subtext?`<text x="${p[3]}" y="${p[4]}" text-anchor="middle" fill="${ink}" font-size="${ss}" font-weight="700">${subtext}</text>`:""}`;break;}
      default: body=`<rect x="12" y="12" width="376" height="176" rx="20" fill="${active}"/>${label(58)}${val(125)}${sub(161)}`;
    }
    return `<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 400 200" role="img" aria-label="${text} ${shown}" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid meet">${body}</svg>`;
  }
  window.CanvasSvgGraphic={templates,defaults,manualTextFields,manualPaintFields,normalizeManualTextFields,render};
})();
